{"id":"d5866f606e95cdcc","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages.md","title":"有向与无向 Hamilton 回路语言","display":"df-hamilton-cycle-languages — 有向与无向 Hamilton 回路语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages","aliases":["73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages"],"display":"df-hamilton-cycle-languages — 有向与无向 Hamilton 回路语言","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4.4–10.4.5, print pp. 465–473; PDF pp. 487–495","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hamilton-cycle-languages — 有向与无向 Hamilton 回路语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f6d4d247465f3c9\" href=\"?note=4f6d4d247465f3c9\" title=\"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding\">73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.4–10.4.5, print pp. 465–473; PDF pp. 487–495"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:V_n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V_n\">\\(\\pi:V_n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V_n\\)</span> 是顶点排列。有向图无自环；无向回路要求至少三个顶点。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i+1\\bmod n\">\\(i+1\\bmod n\\)</span> 只在 n≥1 下求值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DHC}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GCode}^D(n,E):\\operatorname{DGraph}(n,E)\\land n\\ge1\\land\n\\exists\\pi:V_n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V_n\\;\\forall i\\in V_n\\;(\\pi(i),\\pi((i+1)\\bmod n))\\in E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{DHC}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GCode}^D(n,E):\\operatorname{DGraph}(n,E)\\land n\\ge1\\land\n\\exists\\pi:V_n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V_n\\;\\forall i\\in V_n\\;(\\pi(i),\\pi((i+1)\\bmod n))\\in E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{UHC}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GCode}^U(n,E):\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land n\\ge3\\land\n\\exists\\pi:V_n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V_n\\;\\forall i\\in V_n\\;\\{\\pi(i),\\pi((i+1)\\bmod n)\\}\\in E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{UHC}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GCode}^U(n,E):\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land n\\ge3\\land\n\\exists\\pi:V_n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V_n\\;\\forall i\\in V_n\\;\\{\\pi(i),\\pi((i+1)\\bmod n)\\}\\in E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>排列保证每个顶点恰访问一次，再回到起点。无向双顶点来回走同一条边不算简单 Hamilton 圈；有向两条相反边则可形成长度二回路。边界规则显式写在形式条件中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding","status":"resolved","id":"4f6d4d247465f3c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\pi:V_n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V_n","display":false},{"tex":"i+1\\bmod n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DHC}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GCode}^D(n,E):\\operatorname{DGraph}(n,E)\\land n\\ge1\\land\n\\exists\\pi:V_n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V_n\\;\\forall i\\in V_n\\;(\\pi(i),\\pi((i+1)\\bmod n))\\in E\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{UHC}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{GCode}^U(n,E):\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land n\\ge3\\land\n\\exists\\pi:V_n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V_n\\;\\forall i\\in V_n\\;\\{\\pi(i),\\pi((i+1)\\bmod n)\\}\\in E\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1535,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-253","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages|有向与无向 Hamilton 回路语言]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"f395ad0cda384617","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"853911eb6042f48c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6386d790ff0500e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["4f6d4d247465f3c9"]}